      "start_plus_years": 0,
      "end_minus_years": 0,
      "end_plus_years": 500,
      "note": "EBSCO gives c. 500 B.C.E.-c. 200 C.E. for the Garamantes, who built the foggara; the onset of the foggara themselves is not separately dated on an opened page. Live Science says the technology reached Libya more than 2,000 years ago. National Geographic puts Garamantian rule at roughly the second century B.C. to the seventh century A.D."
